oseout-plans/spec-pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated.json\", \".pose/indexes/delivery-integrity.json\", \".pose/indexes/generation.json\", \".pose/indexes/spec-graph.json\", \".pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json\", \".pose/results/delivery-validation.json\", \".pose/review-attempts/81b30aedfeb57e485064d7ce/000001.json\", \".pose/review-attempts/81b30aedfeb57e485064d7ce/000001.result.json\", \".pose/review-attestations/rva-f215ab03914d85c5.json\", \".pose/review-bundles/rvb-8704a030ec7fc417.json\", \".pose/review-bundles/rvb-e2837d870a9dbb3a.json\", \".pose/review-conclusions/rrn-c5171f8ff89f3ebb.json\", \".pose/review-run-ledger/rrn-c5171f8ff89f3ebb.json\", \".pose/review-run-proofs/rrn-c5171f8ff89f3ebb/rrp-6c8e5051ada0f7758f8b5faf3c0f948ad4b771d1a51bf0214f4e464adeda0f52.json\", \".pose/review-runs/rrn-c5171f8ff89f3ebb.events.ndjson\", \".pose/review-runs/rrn-c5171f8ff89f3ebb.json\", \".pose/review-runs/rrn-c5171f8ff89f3ebb.transcript\", \".pose/specs/2026-11-15-pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated.md\", \".pose/starts/pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated.json\", \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_git_untranslated_test.go\", \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_git.go\", \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_stream.go\"]}}]}\n[]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"decision: approved\n\nR1-F1 is fixed. No new defects found. Both locale tests passed, including the pt_BR regression without skipping. Focused audit, budget, cancellation, and concurrency tests passed. The subject engine built; artifact-check and surface-check passed. The worktree remains unchanged.\n\nRules applied: bugfix review under `.pose/workflows/review.md`, with backend-go, security, documentation-style, and delivery-evidence rules. Full validation uses the sealed producer evidence.\n\n```pose-draft\n{\n  \"schema\": \"pose.review.draft/v1\",\n  \"decision\": \"approved\",\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"prior_findings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"R1-F1\",\n      \"status\": \"fixed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"governance_read_view_git.go:637 defines LC_ALL=C and LANGUAGE=C; captured runner line 649 and streaming runner governance_read_view_stream.go:230 append that shared environment. Independently ran TestEveryGovernanceGitRunnerIsUntranslated and TestGovernanceGitIsReadUntranslated: both passed, neither skipped.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"sweep\": \"Reviewed the complete implementation diff, validation-matrix addition, start record, spec R1/D1, both captured and streaming runners including observation and final-audit routing, gitCommandContext environment construction, production consumers, module-discovery stderr classification, and adjacent snapshotGit, previewGit, gitCheckIgnore and gitOutputUntranslated paths. Inspected bounds, typed errors, cancellation, concurrency, raw-history protections and locale-sensitive output assumptions. Built the subject engine and ran focused regression and lifecycle tests; artifact-check and surface-check passed. No new defects established.\",\n  \"criteria\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"assumption-integrity\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Verified that appended environment values override inherited values through the two-runner regression and local Go os/exec implementation. Inspected consumers using object data, explicit formats and porcelain output; found no locale-dependent parsed stdout. The translated regression can skip where pt_BR is unavailable, but it ran here and the environment regression does not require translation. No unresolved material assumption or accepted risk.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"backend-concurrency\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-read-view-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The shared environment is read-only after initialization and appended to each command independently. Existing locking, cancellation and process joining remain intact. Independently passed concurrent streamed-read comparison, audit, budget and caller-cancellation tests.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"backend-contracts\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/cli-mcp-operation-results-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"No public signatures, schemas, tool definitions or file formats changed; the change normalizes subprocess diagnostics.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"backend-input-errors\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Verified non-repository classification under pt_BR. Bounded stderr, output admission and GitSnapshotError propagation remain intact; focused budget and warning tests passed.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"backend-integration-impact\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Traced module discovery and production artifact-integrity consumers through both runners; the coordinator regression and strict surface-check passed.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"backend-observability\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/typed-diagnostics-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Failures retain operation context and bounded stderr through existing typed errors. Locale normalization improves classification without adding logging or sensitive output.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"compatibility\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/cli-mcp-operation-results-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Examined CLI/MCP consumers and error wrapping. Public contracts remain unchanged; C-locale sessions retain existing behavior, and translated sessions receive deterministic internal Git diagnostics.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"correctness\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Both runners append the required overrides. Independently built the subject and passed locale, coordinator, captured-read and streamed-read regression tests.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"design-causality\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"structure:design-2cb3bb3a223a46ad\",\n      \"rationale\": \"R1 requires untranslated diagnostics for every governance Git command. D1 selects subprocess locale normalization because matching translated phrases would require maintaining Git translations. The shared environment reaches both execution paths and their audits, addressing the original cause and the previous round's omission. No individual structural delta facts were listed in the brief.\",\n      \"mappings\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"documentation\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Compared the spec, shared-environment comment, regression tests and required validation-matrix command. They describe and exercise both runners; no operational command or template contract changes.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"operability\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Non-repository directories are classified correctly under pt_BR, while other failures retain bounded forensic stderr and operation context. No new configuration or remediation step is required.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"requirements\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"R1 is covered by direct environment assertions for both runners and the translated coordinator regression. Independently executed both successfully.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scope\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"structure:design-2cb3bb3a223a46ad\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Implementation changes are limited to the environment of the two governance Git runners, regression coverage and its validation registration. Adjacent non-governance runners remain outside the spec's explicit scope.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"security\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/git-and-dispatch-snapshot-integrity-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Inspected subprocess construction, environment filtering, raw-history restrictions, argument handling and output bounds. The change adds fixed locale values and preserves path, authority, cancellation and diagnostic boundaries; no secret material or dependency was introduced.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"solution-proportionality\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"structure:design-2cb3bb3a223a46ad\",\n      \"rationale\": \"One shared environment value applied at the two execution points is the smallest cohesive correction covering R1. It avoids translation tables, new abstractions and changes to unrelated runners. Reconsider if future governance commands require localized semantic stdout or another execution path bypasses these runners.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tools\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"artifact-check\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"command:/tmp/pose-review-8704a030 artifact-check --spec pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated --strict\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Ran the engine built from the subject commit; exited 0. Reported repository-wide orphan warnings but no blocking findings; a JSON inspection confirmed no non-warning findings.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"assess-design\",\n      \"disposition\": \"not-used\",\n      \"evidence\": \"structure:design-2cb3bb3a223a46ad\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Used sealed design evidence and independently inspected R1/D1 and both execution paths; did not regenerate assessment artifacts in this read-only review.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"assess-discover\",\n      \"component\": \"pose-mcp\",\n      \"disposition\": \"not-used\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-read-view-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"No component discovery refresh was needed for the bounded environment change; avoided assessment writes.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"assess-integrate\",\n      \"disposition\": \"not-used\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"No inter-module public contract changed. Independently traced production consumers and ran coordinator integration coverage without generating assessment artifacts.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"assess-tech-debt\",\n      \"disposition\": \"not-used\",\n      \"evidence\": \"command:rg -n 'TODO|FIXME|stub|panic' pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_git_untranslated_test.go pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_git.go pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_stream.go\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Performed a read-only marker sweep of the affected implementation and tests; no markers found. Did not generate assessment artifacts.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"closeout-check\",\n      \"disposition\": \"deferred\",\n      \"evidence\": \"command:/tmp/pose-review-8704a030 context --task spec:pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated --json\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Requires completion and recording of this independent review; no attestation was recorded.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"review-check\",\n      \"disposition\": \"deferred\",\n      \"evidence\": \"command:/tmp/pose-review-8704a030 context --task spec:pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated --json\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Requires POSE to record this review conclusion first.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"suggest-review\",\n      \"component\": \"pose-mcp\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"command:/tmp/pose-review-8704a030 suggest review --path pose-mcp\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Resolved backend-go, security and documentation-style rules and applied them.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"surface-check\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Ran /tmp/pose-review-8704a030 surface-check --spec pose-governance-git-reads-untranslated --strict using the subject engine: exited 0, one target, zero findings.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"validate\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Uses the sealed strict-validation producer results listed in the brief, including build, integration and e2e results. Did not rerun the repository-writing validation command during this read-only review.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"validate\",\n      \"component\": \"pose-mcp\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-git-reads-untranslated-integration\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Uses sealed component validation results. Independently built the subject and reran locale, coordinator, captured-read, streaming, audit, budget, cancellation and concurrency tests successfully.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}}
